---
description: How to edit Ben Turner’s public CV and company packs.
globs: file/cv-ai-generation/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `file/cv-ai-generation/CONTEXT.md`.

- Public site: edit `cv.md`, run `export.ps1`, bump `?v=` on download links.
- Company request: create `packs/{Company} - {Role}/` with tailored `cv.md` and export `Ben-Turner-CV.pdf` into that folder. Do not change the public master for one employer.
- Do not hand-edit `cv.html` or PDFs.
